				<title>Scrappers Paradise热修：第二关卡关Bug已修复</title>
				<link>https://info.steamhunter.link/posts/2026-10-27-4789400-d6a99527/</link>
				<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 03:33:50 +0800</pubDate>
